user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T20:40:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n - Reproducible in:\n   - v4.7.stable.official [5b4e0cb0f]\n   - v4.8.dev4.official [b56a91878]\n   - v4.6.3.stable.official [7d41c59c4]\n   - v4.5.2.stable.official [6ce3de25a]\n   - v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n   - v4.0.stable.official [92bee43ad]\n      - Slightly different behavior but still specific to MSAA 3D 8x - Object with proximity fade just disappears entirely\n \n - Not Reproducible:\n   - When disabling MSAA 3D or setting it to 4x or 2x.\n   - Using the gl_compatibility set as the renderer with 4.7 on MacOS \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.6.2) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M2 Max (Apple8) - Apple M2 Max (12 threads) - 32.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a MeshInstance3D's texture has Proximity Fade enabled, it does not work as expected **on MacOS** when the renderer is set to Forward+ and MSAA 3D is set to 8x.\n\nThe edges of the object that collides with other meshes does not fade itself out properly.\n\n### MacOS 4.7:\n**MSAA 3D 8x:**\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16ea477e-becf-4da4-995f-4a07e660a276\" />\n\n**MSAA 3D 4x:**\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5311e51e-f004-4460-8a6a-55975c03fa89\" />\n\n\n### Windows 4.7 with MSAA 3D 8x:\n<img width=\"2559\" height=\"1439\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75417382-1a56-451a-ab98-6007e9515461\" />\n\n### Linux 4.7 with MSAA 3D 8x:\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/157eb748-ae83-43ee-8a8e-d591f3c16a74\" />\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create Project in MacOS with Forward+ rendering.\n2. Open Project settings and enable MSAA 3D at 8x.\n3. Create a 3D Node.\n4. Create two StaticBody3Ds\n5. Under each StaticBody3D, create either CSGMesh3D or MeshInstance3D\n6. Select a Mesh shape for both MeshInstances (ex: BoxMesh).\n7. Give both MeshInstances Mesh's a new StandardMaterial3D under the Material property.\n8. Enable ProximityFade on one of them. (setting a contrasting Albedo value also helps illustrate the issue)\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[minimal-reproduction-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32253292/minimal-reproduction-project.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123478/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123478/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}